{"3892330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fynn's Passage", "steam_appid": 3892330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fynn's Passage is a Stylized Action-Adventure game packed with sword and gunplay combat.  Get immersed in an underground world of extraordinary creatures, items to discover, unique NPCs, and challenging puzzles to solve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight with a Sword or a Gun...or both!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your <strong>sword</strong> equipped you can slice up your enemies and execute combo attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your <strong>pulse rifle</strong> equipped you can shoot up your enemies from a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between the two weapons seamlessly for balanced gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot, Trade, and Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover collectible items as you explore. Trade with memorable NPCs to obtain <strong>Rare</strong> items. Completing a full <strong>Set</strong> will reward the player with a <strong>Charm. </strong>Each <strong>Charm </strong>will unlock a unique player <strong>buff</strong>, enhancing gameplay experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environmental Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to solve puzzles in order to obtain <strong>key items</strong> that are necessary to progress through the game. Each puzzle is unique and challenging.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience grand boss fights involving a combination of solving puzzles, combat, and damage phases. Get ready to utilize all the skills you've learned up to this point in the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Didn't find all items you were looking for? Playing again will <strong>Re-Roll</strong> all the collectible items in the game, giving you more opportunities to complete your <strong>collections</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All living species were forced underground thousands of years ago. Now play as &quot;Fynn&quot; as you seek to uncover the secrets of these mysterious caverns. Speak with NPCs to learn more about what happened in the old times. Observe unique items that bare clues to a world long past. Strive to eventually make your way to the surface in search of the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fynn's Passage is a Stylized Action-Adventure game packed with sword and gunplay combat.  Get immersed in an underground world of extraordinary creatures, items to discover, unique NPCs, and challenging puzzles to solve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight with a Sword or a Gun...or both!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your <strong>sword</strong> equipped you can slice up your enemies and execute combo attacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your <strong>pulse rifle</strong> equipped you can shoot up your enemies from a distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between the two weapons seamlessly for balanced gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot, Trade, and Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover collectible items as you explore. Trade with memorable NPCs to obtain <strong>Rare</strong> items. Completing a full <strong>Set</strong> will reward the player with a <strong>Charm. </strong>Each <strong>Charm </strong>will unlock a unique player <strong>buff</strong>, enhancing gameplay experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environmental Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to solve puzzles in order to obtain <strong>key items</strong> that are necessary to progress through the game. Each puzzle is unique and challenging.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boss Fights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience grand boss fights involving a combination of solving puzzles, combat, and damage phases. Get ready to utilize all the skills you've learned up to this point in the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Didn't find all items you were looking for? Playing again will <strong>Re-Roll</strong> all the collectible items in the game, giving you more opportunities to complete your <strong>collections</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All living species were forced underground thousands of years ago. Now play as &quot;Fynn&quot; as you seek to uncover the secrets of these mysterious caverns. Speak with NPCs to learn more about what happened in the old times. Observe unique items that bare clues to a world long past. Strive to eventually make your way to the surface in search of the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Play as &quot;Fynn&quot; as you make your way through an underground labyrinth, fighting against mobs of malicious creatures. Switch between weapons seamlessly for balanced combat. Explore caverns, discover collectible items, trade with friendly NPCs, and solve various puzzles.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892330/db9509128ea40d0537e1e1810b36f75459283437/header.jpg?t=1777746328", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892330/6e3db4b6635d90e87ca8f9a36425f1621bc39b7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777746328", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892330/6e3db4b6635d90e87ca8f9a36425f1621bc39b7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777746328", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</s